fi # as_fn_append

@%:@ as_fn_arith ARG...
@%:@ ------------------
@%:@ Perform arithmetic evaluation on the ARGs, and store the result in the
@%:@ global @S|@as_val. Take advantage of shells that can avoid forks. The arguments
@%:@ must be portable across @S|@(()) and expr.
